ROADMAP

Why are we here?
Based Catchers Digital Collective exists to solve a simple problem: most NFT projects suck. This space has been chock full of simple cash grabs, money laundering schemes, and half-assed jpegs that should have stayed on Adobe. We deserve better. This space deserves better.
Based Catchers blends our creative storytelling, gamification, and blockchain technology into a unique, digital ecosystem built to last. And yes, you’ll also have a dope, rare pfp.

Phase 1
Pre-mint.
Allowlist spots will be given to various communities and members of the NFT community at large that we believe will be invaluable token holders and community members.

Phase 2
Mint.
You have never seen a mint like this.
For just 0.1 ETH, you will receive a first edition BCDC pack of collectibles. Each pack contains 1 Based Catcher, 1 Skick, and 3 Droids. All of which will prove invaluable assets in the BCDC universe.

Phase 3
Game.
Feeling angry? Challenge members of the Based Catcher community for droids and weapons (single-use and multi-use items). Gather fuel and trade tokens for droids and token enhancements. Don't care? Don’t worry. Your experience in BCDC is whatever you make of it.
 
Phase 4
Boosters.
Feeling angrier? For 0.05, you can purchase booster packs to enhance your BCDC team and participate in the Based Catcher universe. Each booster contains three (3) NFTs. Every 1 out of 10 booster packs will contain a Skick. Every 1 out of 100 booster packs will contain a v1 Based Catcher, which will be capped at 20,000 tokens.

Phase 5
TBD.
We hated roadmaps that jumped to 2030 to solve problems their founders knew weren’t on the docket. So we’re going to stop writing now.
